  "interpretation": "The broad monotonic identifier-complexity \u00d7 budget hypothesis is not confirmed: every confirmatory slope and low-to-high interval includes zero. Qwen nevertheless has significant UUID deficits at 128 and 1,024 tokens, which supports a persistent binding cost but not monotonic recovery with budget. Gemma E2B shows the predicted constrained-budget failure at 64 tokens (UUID minus numeric: -35 points), followed by a sharp non-monotonic reversal; removing UUID reproduction improves its accuracy by 45 and 50 points at 512 and 1,024 tokens. Tiny Aya's significant positive pilot slope does not replicate. No model has a source-count interaction whose interval excludes zero. UUIDs do reliably increase total generated output: the UUID-minus-numeric interval is strictly positive in 14 of 15 model-budget cells, but scratchpad-token direction is model-dependent.",
